:"Jackson attacks Bottoms' record as Atlanta mayor during the 2020 unrest, while Bottoms says the attacks distort her record.","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/secoriea-turner-family-condemns-rick-jackson-ad/"},{"issue":"Health care and Medicaid","why":"Bottoms wants full Medicaid expansion and says Jackson profited from a broken health system, while Jackson backs a state waiver with work requirements.","src":"https://www.atlantanewsfirst.com/2026/09/17/bottoms-airs-first-true-attack-ad-linking-jackson-rigged-system/"},{"issue":"Data centers","why":"Bottoms calls for a pause on new data centers and questions Jackson's investments, while Jackson notes she approved a Midtown project with incentives.","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/georgia-governors-race-follow-along-as-the-candidates-debate-on-tuesday/"},{"issue":"Affordability and taxes","why":"Jackson says voters care about gas prices, bills and property taxes, while Bottoms pledges to repeal the state grocery tax.","src":"https://www.wabe.org/bottoms-faces-empty-podium-on-debate-stage-while-jackson-campaigns-with-kemp/"},{"issue":"Abortion","why":"Bottoms used the debate he skipped to press Jackson on how rape exceptions work under Georgia's six week ban, which his campaign says mischaracterizes him.","src":"https://www.wabe.org/bottoms-faces-empty-podium-on-debate-stage-while-jackson-campaigns-with-kemp/"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Bottoms reports 23 million dollar haul","date":"2026-10-22","what":"Bottoms raised 23.2 million dollars since August with big DGA help, though Jackson has bought 87 million dollars in general election airtime from mostly his own money.","helps":"mixed","kind":"national","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/keisha-lance-bottoms-fundraising/"},{"title":"AJC poll finds a dead heat","date":"2026-10-20","what":"Jackson led 46 to 45 among likely voters, with Bottoms ahead among independents and Democrats far more enthusiastic than Republicans.","helps":"mixed","kind":"national","src":"https://www.wsbtv.com/news/local/ajcuga-poll-bottoms-jackson-dead-heat-georgia-governor-race/76TN3NROXRG4HDILVYDUMJS4RQ/"},{"title":"Jackson keeps distance from Trump","date":"2026-10-20","what":"Jackson, who once promised to be Trump's favorite governor, skipped a Trump rally for a Cherokee County event and casts himself as Kemp's heir.","helps":"R","kind":"national","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/rick-jackson-has-outspent-keisha-lance-bottoms-but-democratic-enthusiasm-has-the-race-knotted/"},{"title":"Jackson skips Atlanta Press Club debate","date":"2026-10-12","what":"Bottoms debated an empty podium and called Jackson a coward, while Jackson campaigned with Kemp and said voters care about costs, not debates.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.wabe.org/bottoms-faces-empty-podium-on-debate-stage-while-jackson-campaigns-with-kemp/"},{"title":"Family condemns Jackson crime ad","date":"2026-10-08","what":"The family of Secoriea Turner asked Jackson to pull an ad using her mother's 911 call, and his campaign said it will keep highlighting Bottoms' record as mayor.","helps":"D","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/secoriea-turner-family-condemns-rick-jackson-ad/"},{"title":"Lone debate clash over data centers","date":"2026-10-06","what":"Bottoms said Jackson cannot be trusted on data centers and tied him to Trump, and Jackson hit her public safety record and her own data center approvals.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/georgia-governors-race-follow-along-as-the-candidates-debate-on-tuesday/"},{"title":"Bottoms launches rigged system ad","date":"2026-09-17","what":"Bottoms' first on camera attack ad says Jackson made his fortune off a broken health system and touts her grocery tax repeal and Medicaid expansion.","helps":"D","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.atlantanewsfirst.com/2026/09/17/bottoms-airs-first-true-attack-ad-linking-jackson-rigged-system/"}],"e